    "question_type": "numerical",
    "question_text": "For an amplitude modulated wave, the maximum amplitude is found to be 100 V while the minimum amplitude is found to be 2 V. Determine the modulation index μ. What would be the value of μ if the minimum amplitude is zero volt?",
