      "source_image_index": null,
      "ownership": "question"
    },
    "parts": [],
    "answer_text": "The modulation index μ is calculated as μ = \\frac{A_{max} - A_{min}}{A_{max} + A_{min}} = \\frac{100 - 2}{100 + 2} = \\frac{98}{102} \\approx 0.96. If the minimum amplitude is zero, μ = 1.",
